---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Icon from '../system/components/Icon.astro';
import MediaText from '../system/blocks/Media/Text.astro';
import Facilities from '../system/blocks/Feature/Grid.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import headPhoto from '../assets/images/head-of-school.png';
import storyPhoto from '../assets/images/signboard.png';

// The same three values the homepage shows, from the same files.
const values = (await getCollection('values')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<Layout
  title={`About - ${site.name}`}
  description="Unifac Group of Schools teaches nursery, primary and secondary pupils on three campuses in Benin City, Edo State, following the Nigerian national curriculum."
  active="about"
>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the School</p>
    <h1>Knowledge from God, and the work to match it.</h1>
    <p>We teach children from nursery through to senior secondary on three campuses across Benin City. Our motto is on the crest at every gate, and it is meant plainly: what a child learns here is a gift, and we expect them to carry it well.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="welcome">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="photo">
      <Image src={headPhoto} alt="A classroom at Unifac Group of Schools" widths={[480, 768, 1100]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 92vw, 46vw" format="webp" quality={76} loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Welcome to {site.shortName}</p>
      <h2>A word from the school.</h2>
      <blockquote>“We would rather a child left here able to think, and honest about what they do not yet know, than able to recite. The certificates matter and they are the floor, not the ceiling.”</blockquote>
      <div class="signoff">The {site.shortName} Team<small>Knowledge from God</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<MediaText
  image={storyPhoto}
  alt="The Unifac Group of Schools signboard, reading Nursery, Primary, Secondary"
  eyebrow="Our Story"
  title="Three campuses, one school."
  reverse={true}
>
  <p>The name on the gate is a group rather than a single school: three campuses across Benin City, teaching the same syllabus to the same standard, so a family that moves house does not have to move schools. What holds them together is the line under the crest.</p>
  <p>We teach on three campuses in Benin City: the head office at Oliha Quarters, a second campus at Evbuotubu Quarters by Aigbangbe Junction, and Ogbomwan Campus out at Ugbiyoko Quarters. All three follow the Nigerian national curriculum, from the pre-primary years through Primary 1 to 6, then JSS 1 to 3 for the Basic Education Certificate, and SSS 1 to 3 for the WASSCE and NECO examinations.</p>
  <p>Beyond the syllabus there is the music studio, the art room and the field, and the run of inter-house competition and performance that fills out a school year. A child who spends every hour here at a desk is not getting the whole of it.</p>
  <div class="cta">
    <a class="btn btn-brand" href="/admissions">Explore Admissions <span class="arr">→</span></a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Arrange a Visit</a>
  </div>
</MediaText>

<section class="values" style="background:var(--surface-2)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Our Promise</p><h2>Three commitments, on our crest and in our classrooms.</h2><p>The open book, the ladder and the cap are not decoration. They name what we set out to give every child who joins us.</p></div>
    <div class="values-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.4rem;margin-top:2.6rem">
      {values.map((value) => (
        <div class="vcard">
          <div class="ic"><Icon name={value.data.icon} /></div>
          <h3>{value.data.title}</h3>
          <p>{value.data.summary}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Facilities
  title="Where the learning happens."
  intro="Laboratories, a library, and rooms for music, art and sport, so a child's day is not spent only at a desk."
/>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-300)">Admissions Open</p>
    <h2>Come and see a campus.</h2>
    <p>We take enquiries for every stage, nursery through to SSS 3, on all three campuses. Tell us the year group and the campus you have in mind and we will tell you what is available.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href="/admissions">Start an Enquiry <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/contact">Contact the School</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
